{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17690","headline":"赠从弟茂卿 · 杨巨源","name":"赠从弟茂卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾从骥足杨茂卿，性灵且奇才甚清。\n海内方微风雅道，邺中更有文章盟。\n扣寂由来在渊思，搜奇本自通禅智。\n王维证时符水月，杜甫狂处遗天地。\n流水东西岐路分，幽州迢遰旧来闻。\n若爲向北驱疲马，山似寒空塞似云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}